# Divyavani Cursor Security & Architecture Rules
# Enforces Vibecoded Constitution Security & Double-Palette Block Rules

- Always validate inputs with Zod schemas.
- Sanitize HTML/KaTeX output with DOMPurify.
- Always use UUIDv4 for entity IDs.
- Never place API secrets in client-side code.
- Double-Palette: #09090B Obsidian vs #FFFFFF Alabaster with 1.5px structural borders.
- Keep focus rings visible for WCAG 2.1 AA keyboard accessibility.
